target: internal/push/push.go
verify: go test ./internal/push/ -count=1 -run 'TestCheckDiagnosesBeingUnableToAsk'
expect: nothing could not be asked
why:    gh answering IS being able to ask, even when the report is not among the comments. Dropping this makes a repo with a reachable PR but no git dir report "could not be determined" when gh in fact answered — and this branch was dead to the suite until a case shimmed gh to SUCCEED, because every other test here shims it to fail.
